# Documentation language

Committed project text is **English**: READMEs, changelogs, `RELEASES.md`,
`BACKLOG.md`, comments, commit messages, Cursor rules, CI/deploy docs.

**Exception:** the product overview `README.md` section `### Цель` (that
heading and the Russian paragraphs under it until the next heading). Do not
extend Russian to other sections of that file, to module READMEs, or to
release notes.
